(5605459, 812581, 34938, '<td valign="top">that''s really interesting lighting...I do like the tones and mystery in this...Judi????</td>', 'that''s really interesting lighting...I do like the tones and mystery in this...Judi????', '2009-08-10 01:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
