(5605508, 812890, 107929, '<td valign="top">Great shot but the blow out on the first light takes away from the rest.</td>', 'Great shot but the blow out on the first light takes away from the rest.', '2009-08-10 01:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605511, 812867, 107929, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors in this shot.pulls you all the way down the tunnel.</td>', 'wonderful colors in this shot.pulls you all the way down the tunnel.', '2009-08-10 01:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605518, 812427, 90624, '<td valign="top">Ohh I like this. Simple but the shadows really pull you in makes you want to lean and try to look around the bend!</td>', 'Ohh I like this. Simple but the shadows really pull you in makes you want to lean and try to look around the bend!', '2009-08-10 01:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605519, 812886, 90624, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot all the way thru!</td>', 'Nice clear shot all the way thru!', '2009-08-10 01:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605523, 812577, 62727, '<td valign="top">How fortunate to live near this!  Stunning photo!</td>', 'How fortunate to live near this!  Stunning photo!', '2009-08-10 02:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605528, 812872, 62727, '<td valign="top">Powerful image....it speaks volumes. 10</td>', 'Powerful image....it speaks volumes. 10', '2009-08-10 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605530, 812581, 62727, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  Just a few "suggestions" for you:  Her face is dirty but her shirt is very white.  I like the pose but I think it would have more impact if she were crouching in the shadows.  The lighting is a bit too bright on her.  But this was very creative and interesting.  Your image fits the challenge and is crisp and clear. Giving you an 8!</td>', 'I really like this!  Just a few "suggestions" for you:  Her face is dirty but her shirt is very white.  I like the pose but I think it would have more impact if she were crouching in the shadows.  The lighting is a bit too bright on her.  But this was very creative and interesting.  Your image fits the challenge and is crisp and clear. Giving you an 8!', '2009-08-10 02:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605535, 812911, 62727, '<td valign="top">Nice to see an unusual "take" on tunnels and caves.  I like this! 8</td>', 'Nice to see an unusual "take" on tunnels and caves.  I like this! 8', '2009-08-10 02:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605539, 812872, 32011, '<td valign="top">Clearly a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a> photo... and my tip for the blue in this challenge.  I love the story this image tells, with the juxtaposition between the communters and the homeless.  You''ve processed this brilliantly... colours and composition are perfect.</td>', 'Clearly a  hotpasta photo... and my tip for the blue in this challenge.  I love the story this image tells, with the juxtaposition between the communters and the homeless.  You''ve processed this brilliantly... colours and composition are perfect.', '2009-08-10 02:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605541, 812594, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love this image... the minimalism is beautiful.  The colour and composition is superb, especially the use of the leading lines.  Predicting this will ribbon.</td>', 'I love this image... the minimalism is beautiful.  The colour and composition is superb, especially the use of the leading lines.  Predicting this will ribbon.', '2009-08-10 02:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605544, 812841, 50641, '<td valign="top">like the processing, colors and the odd little man.</td>', 'like the processing, colors and the odd little man.', '2009-08-10 02:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605545, 812729, 107730, '<td valign="top">It''s actually the Melba tunnel entrance, but great shot though.</td>', 'It''s actually the Melba tunnel entrance, but great shot though.', '2009-08-10 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605574, 812897, 22301, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the tonal range in this image. It looks really nice from about 10 feet away from the monitor. I got a nice appreciation of the light and hints of shapes.</td>', 'I enjoy the tonal range in this image. It looks really nice from about 10 feet away from the monitor. I got a nice appreciation of the light and hints of shapes.', '2009-08-10 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605584, 812461, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really like the seascape, but I feel like the color is too strong.</td>', 'I really like the seascape, but I feel like the color is too strong.', '2009-08-10 03:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605588, 812858, 22301, '<td valign="top">That is cool how you used a worklight to light the scene and use it in the shot too. I also like all the darkness.</td>', 'That is cool how you used a worklight to light the scene and use it in the shot too. I also like all the darkness.', '2009-08-10 03:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605591, 812769, 22301, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the high contrast. I like how the car seems so looming.</td>', 'I enjoy the high contrast. I like how the car seems so looming.', '2009-08-10 03:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605594, 812884, 22301, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the wide angle, it gives the image a chance to show off the long lines of the station.</td>', 'I enjoy the wide angle, it gives the image a chance to show off the long lines of the station.', '2009-08-10 03:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605596, 812527, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like this, to me it looks like a headlight of an old car.</td>', 'I like this, to me it looks like a headlight of an old car.', '2009-08-10 03:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605598, 812693, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the image composition a lot. It looks like a flag. My eye is drawn to the white sky. Maybe in black and white the other tones might be able to get some more attention. I like the light off the water reflecting on to the underside of  the tunnel.</td>', 'I like the image composition a lot. It looks like a flag. My eye is drawn to the white sky. Maybe in black and white the other tones might be able to get some more attention. I like the light off the water reflecting on to the underside of  the tunnel.', '2009-08-10 03:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605600, 812283, 22301, '<td valign="top">cool, I enjoy its dynamics. It almost like the model is falling down an air duct shaft.</td>', 'cool, I enjoy its dynamics. It almost like the model is falling down an air duct shaft.', '2009-08-10 03:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605603, 812363, 22301, '<td valign="top">This must have been a fun shoot. Or maybe you made a giant doughnut for the model to lay in. :)</td>', 'This must have been a fun shoot. Or maybe you made a giant doughnut for the model to lay in. :)', '2009-08-10 03:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605605, 812907, 22301, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. Really like it. That place looks like it would be fun to shoot.</td>', 'This is awesome. Really like it. That place looks like it would be fun to shoot.', '2009-08-10 03:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605607, 812383, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the artificial and natural light. The sky seems odd though. I like how the tunnel is a small part of the image and almost looks like an eye.</td>', 'I like the balance between the artificial and natural light. The sky seems odd though. I like how the tunnel is a small part of the image and almost looks like an eye.', '2009-08-10 03:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605610, 812689, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like greens running through the image. I can''t place what it is, but the image seems to smooth like some details are blurred.  I also like the reflection of the tree.</td>', 'I like greens running through the image. I can''t place what it is, but the image seems to smooth like some details are blurred.  I also like the reflection of the tree.', '2009-08-10 03:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605611, 812577, 30712, '<td valign="top">Lucky you, having access to this colourful underground world.  Dare I say that in this environment it would be difficult not to capture a pretty good image but you have certainly used your skills to maximize the photographic potential of this cave system.  Brilliant!</td>', 'Lucky you, having access to this colourful underground world.  Dare I say that in this environment it would be difficult not to capture a pretty good image but you have certainly used your skills to maximize the photographic potential of this cave system.  Brilliant!', '2009-08-10 03:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605614, 812882, 30712, '<td valign="top">The arty feel of this image gives this tunnel a quality lacking in many other similar shots.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The arty feel of this image gives this tunnel a quality lacking in many other similar shots.  Nicely done.', '2009-08-10 03:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605615, 812608, 22301, '<td valign="top">It does have beastly qualities. :) The clouds add a nice dimension.</td>', 'It does have beastly qualities. :) The clouds add a nice dimension.', '2009-08-10 03:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605616, 811837, 30712, '<td valign="top">You have made the right decision to go down the monochrome route with this picture.  The textures are lovely and the small depth of field enhances the menace of the spider.</td>', 'You have made the right decision to go down the monochrome route with this picture.  The textures are lovely and the small depth of field enhances the menace of the spider.', '2009-08-10 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605617, 812882, 22301, '<td valign="top">Very graphic, like a page from a comic book.</td>', 'Very graphic, like a page from a comic book.', '2009-08-10 03:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605618, 812816, 22301, '<td valign="top">Very well processed image, you did lose some highlights but I know thats toughest part of these long exposures. I like how you have so much range but it does not feel tonemapped.</td>', 'Very well processed image, you did lose some highlights but I know thats toughest part of these long exposures. I like how you have so much range but it does not feel tonemapped.', '2009-08-10 03:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605619, 812908, 30712, '<td valign="top">Many pictures are spoiled if there is too much going on in them but this one benefits from the mass of lights and shapes.  You''d expect colour to play an important role but I think that in this case it would ruin the impact.  A great picture.</td>', 'Many pictures are spoiled if there is too much going on in them but this one benefits from the mass of lights and shapes.  You''d expect colour to play an important role but I think that in this case it would ruin the impact.  A great picture.', '2009-08-10 03:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605622, 812758, 30712, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image and the wonderful rich colours that demand them attention of the viewer.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image and the wonderful rich colours that demand them attention of the viewer.', '2009-08-10 03:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605624, 812592, 30712, '<td valign="top">Normally this sort of image would not appeal but I love the bold lines, rich colours and sharp edges.</td>', 'Normally this sort of image would not appeal but I love the bold lines, rich colours and sharp edges.', '2009-08-10 03:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605626, 811949, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the mixing of light and the slant in the road.</td>', 'I like the mixing of light and the slant in the road.', '2009-08-10 03:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605627, 812819, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection at the bottom and I see a few faces on the left.</td>', 'I like the reflection at the bottom and I see a few faces on the left.', '2009-08-10 03:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605628, 812892, 22301, '<td valign="top">looks like an eye.</td>', 'looks like an eye.', '2009-08-10 04:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605629, 811822, 22301, '<td valign="top">The General on his way home from Concord? Looks to be the Caldecott tunnel.</td>', 'The General on his way home from Concord? Looks to be the Caldecott tunnel.', '2009-08-10 04:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605631, 812751, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is really cool, I like the reflections on the walls. Cool use of wide angle too.</td>', 'this is really cool, I like the reflections on the walls. Cool use of wide angle too.', '2009-08-10 04:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605636, 812910, 22301, '<td valign="top">I love the way you used the cave''s light. I want to check this movie out.</td>', 'I love the way you used the cave''s light. I want to check this movie out.', '2009-08-10 04:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605638, 812872, 22301, '<td valign="top">very crisp, the somewhat muted color makes me think of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hotpasta</a></td>', 'very crisp, the somewhat muted color makes me think of  Hotpasta', '2009-08-10 04:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605642, 812594, 22301, '<td valign="top">sweet shot. Like the whole thing. I enjoy how the people are in the brightest spot in the image.</td>', 'sweet shot. Like the whole thing. I enjoy how the people are in the brightest spot in the image.', '2009-08-10 04:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605649, 812563, 106806, '<td valign="top">Nice. If I were to be presumptious as to suggest an improvement B&amp;W? I think it would bring out the classic pose of the lass? I grew up in Stoke-on-Trent (England), we always used to take the girls to the local rail tunnel there being nothing else much to write home about from that town so for me ''The Usual Rendezvous'' ;-)</td>', 'Nice. If I were to be presumptious as to suggest an improvement B&W? I think it would bring out the classic pose of the lass? I grew up in Stoke-on-Trent (England), we always used to take the girls to the local rail tunnel there being nothing else much to write home about from that town so for me ''The Usual Rendezvous'' ;-)', '2009-08-10 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605685, 812461, 21255, '<td valign="top">very pretty 8/10</td>', 'very pretty 8/10', '2009-08-10 05:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605701, 812383, 17186, '<td valign="top">nice, tunnel 2. us-6, clear creek canyon. I drive through this tunnel 10 times or so, every week. (work in Blackhawk) I was going to take a picture of this one too. have a few good shots from the double yellow in the middle of the road but there was too much traffic when i tried this time... you went to some effort to get this perspective and did a little climbing around. those darn street lights (and minus a power pole or two...) things sure are a lot more green than usual this year! my favorite thus far!</td>', 'nice, tunnel 2. us-6, clear creek canyon. I drive through this tunnel 10 times or so, every week. (work in Blackhawk) I was going to take a picture of this one too. have a few good shots from the double yellow in the middle of the road but there was too much traffic when i tried this time... you went to some effort to get this perspective and did a little climbing around. those darn street lights (and minus a power pole or two...) things sure are a lot more green than usual this year! my favorite thus far!', '2009-08-10 06:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605705, 812689, 104650, '<td valign="top">Sorry, my ''tunnel vision'' keeps going down the tunnel, and <br/>not where you want it to go. The background might be too light.</td>', 'Sorry, my ''tunnel vision'' keeps going down the tunnel, and not where you want it to go. The background might be too light.', '2009-08-10 07:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605715, 812581, 104650, '<td valign="top">Too clean to be convincing, sorry. Or am I missing something?</td>', 'Too clean to be convincing, sorry. Or am I missing something?', '2009-08-10 07:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605731, 812854, 104650, '<td valign="top">Not sure if that counts as a tunnel (it''s not a cave, that''s for sure). <br/>I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, though. It''s a nice pic, however<br/>the blue halos around the trees/leafs are not so nice.</td>', 'Not sure if that counts as a tunnel (it''s not a cave, that''s for sure). I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, though. It''s a nice pic, howeverthe blue halos around the trees/leafs are not so nice.', '2009-08-10 07:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
