(5605839, 812582, 15711, '<td valign="top">So unexpected to see a face in this challenge.  It''s awesome! Your use of texture and the monochromatic colors, not to mention the perfect shadow and light play.  WOW - I rarely give 10''s but this is ACE in my opinion. I''m giving one out for this fine image.</td>', 'So unexpected to see a face in this challenge.  It''s awesome! Your use of texture and the monochromatic colors, not to mention the perfect shadow and light play.  WOW - I rarely give 10''s but this is ACE in my opinion. I''m giving one out for this fine image.', '2009-08-10 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605841, 812910, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am such a fan of silhouettes and back lighting!! I just can''t resist the long shadows.</td>', 'I am such a fan of silhouettes and back lighting!! I just can''t resist the long shadows.', '2009-08-10 09:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5605842, 812908, 15711, '<td valign="top">WILD.  I love how the movement makes it look like fireworks are shooting out from the tunnel.  I might''ve brought up the shadow/black a touch. :~)</td>', 'WILD.  I love how the movement makes it look like fireworks are shooting out from the tunnel.  I might''ve brought up the shadow/black a touch. :~)', '2009-08-10 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
