(5606381, 812551, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Not sure if it''s the processing, the capture method, or the subject but it feels a little on the grainy side to me. Good lighting and colors.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Not sure if it''s the processing, the capture method, or the subject but it feels a little on the grainy side to me. Good lighting and colors.', '2009-08-10 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606382, 812786, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. I rated natural above manmade at first but yours and a few others rose above even some of those. I love the duplicity geometry and colors of this.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. I rated natural above manmade at first but yours and a few others rose above even some of those. I love the duplicity geometry and colors of this.', '2009-08-10 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606383, 812872, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Initially I rated the highest scores to the natural not manmade shots but this one rose above many of those. It meets the challenge, it''s technically spot on and it tells a story to boot. Well done! One small bothersome spot is the yellow arrow in that guys crotch. Maybe desaturating that spot would have helped minimize that.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Initially I rated the highest scores to the natural not manmade shots but this one rose above many of those. It meets the challenge, it''s technically spot on and it tells a story to boot. Well done! One small bothersome spot is the yellow arrow in that guys crotch. Maybe desaturating that spot would have helped minimize that.', '2009-08-10 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606384, 812913, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8.', '2009-08-10 17:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606385, 812671, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Well done but for my personal taste I would have liked a little less dramatic lighting. Bringing out just a little more of the plugged up darkness would have made it better imho.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8. Well done but for my personal taste I would have liked a little less dramatic lighting. Bringing out just a little more of the plugged up darkness would have made it better imho.', '2009-08-10 17:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606386, 812908, 66398, '<td valign="top">I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8.</td>', 'I gave two each of 10''s and 9''s then five 8''s the rest were 7 or under. You got an 8.', '2009-08-10 17:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606387, 812710, 66398, '<td valign="top">Initially I rated all the natural shots highest and then there were a few of the manmade tunnel shots that rose above. Yours dropped down just a bit because I rate each challenge by pitting photo against photo. I gave you a 7. Technically it''s okay and it definitely meets the challenge it just doesn''t have the wow factor that some others do.</td>', 'Initially I rated all the natural shots highest and then there were a few of the manmade tunnel shots that rose above. Yours dropped down just a bit because I rate each challenge by pitting photo against photo. I gave you a 7. Technically it''s okay and it definitely meets the challenge it just doesn''t have the wow factor that some others do.', '2009-08-10 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606388, 812566, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. 7</td>', 'Good lighting. 7', '2009-08-10 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606389, 812581, 66398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph. For me though the challenge is about Tunnels and Caves and though this is taken in a tunnel I see the subject of this photo as the girl. The shadow on her chest from the shirt is a drawback for me but the lighting and processing on her face is great! I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph. For me though the challenge is about Tunnels and Caves and though this is taken in a tunnel I see the subject of this photo as the girl. The shadow on her chest from the shirt is a drawback for me but the lighting and processing on her face is great! I gave you a 7.', '2009-08-10 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606390, 812844, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of this type of processing but on this shot I like it.</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of this type of processing but on this shot I like it.', '2009-08-10 17:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606391, 812867, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good coloring, lighting and technicals.</td>', 'Good coloring, lighting and technicals.', '2009-08-10 17:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606392, 812582, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the grungy processing. Technically very well done but as I''ve commented on a couple other shots, the subject to me is the man and not the cave. Still meets the challenge to me but the shots I rated higher were also technically well done but the cave/tunnel was the primary subject in them. Beautiful shot overall though.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the grungy processing. Technically very well done but as I''ve commented on a couple other shots, the subject to me is the man and not the cave. Still meets the challenge to me but the shots I rated higher were also technically well done but the cave/tunnel was the primary subject in them. Beautiful shot overall though.', '2009-08-10 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606393, 812896, 66398, '<td valign="top">Just a bit on the flat side but good composition.</td>', 'Just a bit on the flat side but good composition.', '2009-08-10 17:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606395, 812914, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the processing.', '2009-08-10 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606396, 812193, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt on this.</td>', 'I like the tilt on this.', '2009-08-10 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606397, 812306, 66398, '<td valign="top">Initially I rated the natural shots above all others but this one fell down below a few of the manmade shots based on the technical aspects of those and this. Yours isn''t technically bad just that it could be better and some of the others were really done well technically. It looks like a single on camera flash to me. Maybe it still would have worked okay like that if you had a little sharper focus and maybe in processing adding a little more blacks/contrast and fill light.</td>', 'Initially I rated the natural shots above all others but this one fell down below a few of the manmade shots based on the technical aspects of those and this. Yours isn''t technically bad just that it could be better and some of the others were really done well technically. It looks like a single on camera flash to me. Maybe it still would have worked okay like that if you had a little sharper focus and maybe in processing adding a little more blacks/contrast and fill light.', '2009-08-10 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606398, 811949, 66398, '<td valign="top">I can never get lights to look like that. Good balance on the warm and cool hues. Hey I just noticed. I think this is Portland OR isn''t it.</td>', 'I can never get lights to look like that. Good balance on the warm and cool hues. Hey I just noticed. I think this is Portland OR isn''t it.', '2009-08-10 17:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606399, 812910, 66398, '<td valign="top">coming has one m by the way. Nicely done.</td>', 'coming has one m by the way. Nicely done.', '2009-08-10 17:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606400, 812857, 66398, '<td valign="top">Stepping back a few feet to give a little more of the tunnel or maybe just changing to landscape orientation for a little more of the walls would help this shot imo. overall well done though.</td>', 'Stepping back a few feet to give a little more of the tunnel or maybe just changing to landscape orientation for a little more of the walls would help this shot imo. overall well done though.', '2009-08-10 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606401, 812729, 66398, '<td valign="top">There must be quite a few dpc''ers who live near that tunnel. All of the shots of this tunnel are nice.</td>', 'There must be quite a few dpc''ers who live near that tunnel. All of the shots of this tunnel are nice.', '2009-08-10 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606402, 812401, 66398, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. Technically well done and meets the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting shot. Technically well done and meets the challenge.', '2009-08-10 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606403, 812592, 66398, '<td valign="top">The better of the two shots I''ve seen of this tunnel.</td>', 'The better of the two shots I''ve seen of this tunnel.', '2009-08-10 17:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606404, 812703, 66398, '<td valign="top">Clever title. Not sure how many will get it. Technically spot on and meets the challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Clever title. Not sure how many will get it. Technically spot on and meets the challenge. Nice job.', '2009-08-10 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606405, 812841, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2009-08-10 18:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606406, 812751, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very nice center composition. Great technicals and meets the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice center composition. Great technicals and meets the challenge. Well done.', '2009-08-10 18:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606407, 812920, 66398, '<td valign="top">The better of the two shots in this location imo. Still a tiny bit on the flat side. Maybe a tad bit less exposure on the lower left quadrant by dodging with a little increase in the blacks/contrast would make it better. Overall well done though.</td>', 'The better of the two shots in this location imo. Still a tiny bit on the flat side. Maybe a tad bit less exposure on the lower left quadrant by dodging with a little increase in the blacks/contrast would make it better. Overall well done though.', '2009-08-10 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606408, 812689, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Perfect on the technicals in both capture and processing but for me the subject of this shot is the girl and not the tunnel. Can''t say it doesn''t meet the challenge because it does but there are some really nice shots that for me have the subject more on the tunnel/cave. Still on the above average of my scoring though.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Perfect on the technicals in both capture and processing but for me the subject of this shot is the girl and not the tunnel. Can''t say it doesn''t meet the challenge because it does but there are some really nice shots that for me have the subject more on the tunnel/cave. Still on the above average of my scoring though.', '2009-08-10 18:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606409, 812758, 66398, '<td valign="top">Definitely the most oob shot in the challenge imo. Still meets it it very well because it IS a tunnel. Great colors and lighting too.</td>', 'Definitely the most oob shot in the challenge imo. Still meets it it very well because it IS a tunnel. Great colors and lighting too.', '2009-08-10 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606410, 812461, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2009-08-10 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606412, 812608, 66398, '<td valign="top">Inviting you into the dark crevasses to devour you during the storm.</td>', 'Inviting you into the dark crevasses to devour you during the storm.', '2009-08-10 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606413, 812693, 66398, '<td valign="top">The mouth of the dragon breathing fire to ward off all visitors who dare enter.</td>', 'The mouth of the dragon breathing fire to ward off all visitors who dare enter.', '2009-08-10 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606414, 812685, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure how I feel about the processing.</td>', 'Not sure how I feel about the processing.', '2009-08-10 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606415, 812881, 66398, '<td valign="top">If this is the upper tunnel where''s the lower one? Just kidding. Maybe waiting til a train started to enter the opposite end would have made this better adding value to the danger sign.</td>', 'If this is the upper tunnel where''s the lower one? Just kidding. Maybe waiting til a train started to enter the opposite end would have made this better adding value to the danger sign.', '2009-08-10 18:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606416, 812388, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little more room at the top to bring the tunnels further into the shot? As it stands the tunnels aren''t the primary focus of the image without the title''s help. The first thing that draws my attention is the muck and the pipe.</td>', 'Maybe a little more room at the top to bring the tunnels further into the shot? As it stands the tunnels aren''t the primary focus of the image without the title''s help. The first thing that draws my attention is the muck and the pipe.', '2009-08-10 18:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606417, 812652, 66398, '<td valign="top">Your highlights are blown out and the cool toned outdoors is a little flat looking. I do like the warm tones in the tunnel.</td>', 'Your highlights are blown out and the cool toned outdoors is a little flat looking. I do like the warm tones in the tunnel.', '2009-08-10 18:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606418, 812884, 66398, '<td valign="top">Technically not bad. A tad on the noisy side and maybe a little brightness would help. Definitely meets the challenge its just not that interesting compared to other shots in this group of photos.</td>', 'Technically not bad. A tad on the noisy side and maybe a little brightness would help. Definitely meets the challenge its just not that interesting compared to other shots in this group of photos.', '2009-08-10 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606419, 812816, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good waterfall shot.</td>', 'Good waterfall shot.', '2009-08-10 18:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606420, 812890, 66398, '<td valign="top">You lost detail in the highlights but overall not bad. Interesting processing.</td>', 'You lost detail in the highlights but overall not bad. Interesting processing.', '2009-08-10 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606421, 812891, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you added light to the darkened areas you might have a more interesting shot here.</td>', 'Maybe if you added light to the darkened areas you might have a more interesting shot here.', '2009-08-10 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606422, 812563, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice shot I just think the lighting and composition feature the girl as the subject and not the tunnel/cave. Not saying it it doesn''t meet the challenge, just that there are other shots that meet it better imo. Technically its a great shot though.</td>', 'Nice shot I just think the lighting and composition feature the girl as the subject and not the tunnel/cave. Not saying it it doesn''t meet the challenge, just that there are other shots that meet it better imo. Technically its a great shot though.', '2009-08-10 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606423, 812911, 66398, '<td valign="top">Shallow dof and processing add interest to this.</td>', 'Shallow dof and processing add interest to this.', '2009-08-10 18:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606424, 812854, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m NOT saying dnmc however this says more about the water to me than a tunnel/cave. 5</td>', 'I''m NOT saying dnmc however this says more about the water to me than a tunnel/cave. 5', '2009-08-10 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
