(5606428, 812886, 66398, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Seems like people went out in pairs for this challenge. I keep seeing two of some shots. I usually don''t prefer soft shots like this but at the angle you shot this I think the soft focus/lower contrast works for it. The danger sign above the tunnel is a bit too bright imo though.</td>', 'Hmmm. Seems like people went out in pairs for this challenge. I keep seeing two of some shots. I usually don''t prefer soft shots like this but at the angle you shot this I think the soft focus/lower contrast works for it. The danger sign above the tunnel is a bit too bright imo though.', '2009-08-10 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606429, 812383, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the processing.</td>', 'Love the colors and the processing.', '2009-08-10 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606430, 811728, 66398, '<td valign="top">Monotone is okay but I''d like to see both a color and b/w version of this. I''m betting one of those would be better.</td>', 'Monotone is okay but I''d like to see both a color and b/w version of this. I''m betting one of those would be better.', '2009-08-10 18:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
