(5606432, 812907, 66398, '<td valign="top">The other shot at this location works better for me. This one isn''t bad but the blanket in the foreground of the other one brings more interest as well as the angle of the other one. Both shots have merit I just prefer the other (you both got the same score though).</td>', 'The other shot at this location works better for me. This one isn''t bad but the blanket in the foreground of the other one brings more interest as well as the angle of the other one. Both shots have merit I just prefer the other (you both got the same score though).', '2009-08-10 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
