(5606507, 812582, 52449, '<td valign="top">I like how the facial tones agree with the background cave tones (and also the texture, somewhat). The dust/dirt on the front of the model''s shirt really helps to blend with the overall feel of the walls and ceiling. Excellent portrait, Zack!</td>', 'I like how the facial tones agree with the background cave tones (and also the texture, somewhat). The dust/dirt on the front of the model''s shirt really helps to blend with the overall feel of the walls and ceiling. Excellent portrait, Zack!', '2009-08-10 18:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
