(5607769, 812886, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like seeing the tiny end of the tunnel in all that black. On my computer, it looks alittle overall flat though. I''d try some levels and curves and some dodging and burning - maybe even a touch of Topaz. But that''s just my humble opinion. :)</td>', 'Nice composition and I like seeing the tiny end of the tunnel in all that black. On my computer, it looks alittle overall flat though. I''d try some levels and curves and some dodging and burning - maybe even a touch of Topaz. But that''s just my humble opinion. :)', '2009-08-11 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607779, 812854, 73056, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what causes the fringing on the trees at the skyline. I''ve noticed that in some of my photos as well. This is nicely composed though. This would be a great place to try a long exposure for the water.</td>', 'I''m not sure what causes the fringing on the trees at the skyline. I''ve noticed that in some of my photos as well. This is nicely composed though. This would be a great place to try a long exposure for the water.', '2009-08-11 19:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607781, 812816, 73056, '<td valign="top">Love the softness to the falls and I think the person nicely adds scale to this particular composition.</td>', 'Love the softness to the falls and I think the person nicely adds scale to this particular composition.', '2009-08-11 19:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607784, 812919, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but you lost the detail in the cave which would have made this better. IMHO.</td>', 'Nice composition, but you lost the detail in the cave which would have made this better. IMHO.', '2009-08-11 19:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607790, 812917, 73056, '<td valign="top">I think your composition is good and I get the emotional impact of the title with how you handled the saturation and colors. Leaves me wondering what the impact would be with a sharp version processed the same way.</td>', 'I think your composition is good and I get the emotional impact of the title with how you handled the saturation and colors. Leaves me wondering what the impact would be with a sharp version processed the same way.', '2009-08-11 19:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607792, 812037, 73056, '<td valign="top">Cute shot! I just wish the color was strengthened some and his face and legs were sharper.</td>', 'Cute shot! I just wish the color was strengthened some and his face and legs were sharper.', '2009-08-11 19:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607793, 812819, 73056, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit from greater sharpness and focus. I''d also play around with levels. But that''s just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I think this would benefit from greater sharpness and focus. I''d also play around with levels. But that''s just my humble opinion.', '2009-08-11 19:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607795, 812881, 73056, '<td valign="top">You must of been out shooting with the other guy in this challenge. I like the close up but this also looks a little flat on my screen as well. Looks like it was an overcast day. IMHO, I would play with curves or levels.</td>', 'You must of been out shooting with the other guy in this challenge. I like the close up but this also looks a little flat on my screen as well. Looks like it was an overcast day. IMHO, I would play with curves or levels.', '2009-08-11 19:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607798, 812578, 73056, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice road to walk down. Would be nice to see more details in the trunks of the trees.</td>', 'Looks like a nice road to walk down. Would be nice to see more details in the trunks of the trees.', '2009-08-11 19:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
