(5607934, 812592, 105164, '<td valign="top">I love th colors and the way the light hits the columns and highlights the cave art, but the blurry people on the side ruin it. Maybe a crop to eliminate them.</td>', 'I love th colors and the way the light hits the columns and highlights the cave art, but the blurry people on the side ruin it. Maybe a crop to eliminate them.', '2009-08-11 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5607953, 812582, 105164, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. I even added it to my favorites. A little fill light on his left cheek is desirable, but even without it, I love it. But here is my issue. The challenge is Caves and Tunnels. Although he is in a cave, the subject matter is not a cave. The cave serves only as a backdrop. He isn''t even interacting with the cave. Sorry, just one of my peeves. If the challenge was portraits, I would give it a 7 or 8.</td>', 'I love this picture. I even added it to my favorites. A little fill light on his left cheek is desirable, but even without it, I love it. But here is my issue. The challenge is Caves and Tunnels. Although he is in a cave, the subject matter is not a cave. The cave serves only as a backdrop. He isn''t even interacting with the cave. Sorry, just one of my peeves. If the challenge was portraits, I would give it a 7 or 8.', '2009-08-11 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5608109, 812872, 79720, '<td valign="top">What an fantastically powerful image. The lighting is superb. I fear the literalists will mark you down, but clearly the best entry and I''d give it the Blue.</td>', 'What an fantastically powerful image. The lighting is superb. I fear the literalists will mark you down, but clearly the best entry and I''d give it the Blue.', '2009-08-11 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
