(5609427, 812461, 109329, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the colours in the sky and sea against the black of the cave work wonderfully. Despite looking out of the cave, it''s like we''re being invited in.</td>', 'The contrast of the colours in the sky and sea against the black of the cave work wonderfully. Despite looking out of the cave, it''s like we''re being invited in.', '2009-08-12 19:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609454, 812427, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of the image and the lighting, although it seems to lack a focal point</td>', 'I like the tone of the image and the lighting, although it seems to lack a focal point', '2009-08-12 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609455, 812496, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and artistic I assume, my eye wants it to be more in focus, but I realize that is a personal preference</td>', 'Interesting image and artistic I assume, my eye wants it to be more in focus, but I realize that is a personal preference', '2009-08-12 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609457, 812606, 76598, '<td valign="top">A livestock pen?  Very interesting place and I am impressed that the lighting is such that you can see in the cave and outside without something being too dark or blown out.</td>', 'A livestock pen?  Very interesting place and I am impressed that the lighting is such that you can see in the cave and outside without something being too dark or blown out.', '2009-08-12 19:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609458, 812306, 76598, '<td valign="top">Focus strikes me as being a little soft, contrast not quite strong enough and lacks a focal point</td>', 'Focus strikes me as being a little soft, contrast not quite strong enough and lacks a focal point', '2009-08-12 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609459, 812482, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, I wish there was something dynamic to see outside the cave.</td>', 'Interesting effect, I wish there was something dynamic to see outside the cave.', '2009-08-12 19:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609461, 811728, 76598, '<td valign="top">Great light, love the patterns, very nice image....seems a tad tilted or off center</td>', 'Great light, love the patterns, very nice image....seems a tad tilted or off center', '2009-08-12 20:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609462, 812315, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cool color, to my eye the image lacks a focal point</td>', 'Very cool color, to my eye the image lacks a focal point', '2009-08-12 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609463, 811949, 76598, '<td valign="top">Love the night shots, like the headlights versus tail lights, good color</td>', 'Love the night shots, like the headlights versus tail lights, good color', '2009-08-12 20:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609467, 812884, 76598, '<td valign="top">Good location, it might have been nice to be a little further toward the tracks to get the repeating columns on the left, I think a bit more contrast would be good as well.</td>', 'Good location, it might have been nice to be a little further toward the tracks to get the repeating columns on the left, I think a bit more contrast would be good as well.', '2009-08-12 20:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609470, 812857, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the bricks inside the tunnel and the way the road leads you away, now if there was a young lady walking away in the distance the cake would be iced.</td>', 'I like the bricks inside the tunnel and the way the road leads you away, now if there was a young lady walking away in the distance the cake would be iced.', '2009-08-12 20:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609473, 812907, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the light play is very intriguing and the "breath" really adds to the image</td>', 'Very nice, the light play is very intriguing and the "breath" really adds to the image', '2009-08-12 20:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609474, 812563, 76598, '<td valign="top">cute model and I like the setting, I wish her face conveyed the title</td>', 'cute model and I like the setting, I wish her face conveyed the title', '2009-08-12 20:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609475, 812577, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great colors and I like the processing</td>', 'Very nice, great colors and I like the processing', '2009-08-12 20:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609480, 812919, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking tunnel and I like the old brick on the inside, somehow I wish the image had a story line implied to engage me</td>', 'Interesting looking tunnel and I like the old brick on the inside, somehow I wish the image had a story line implied to engage me', '2009-08-12 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609483, 812579, 76598, '<td valign="top">Colors strike me as odd, but I am color blind.  Is the "white" in the middle light or something in the tunnel...??</td>', 'Colors strike me as odd, but I am color blind.  Is the "white" in the middle light or something in the tunnel...??', '2009-08-12 20:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609487, 812566, 76598, '<td valign="top">The light play is nice in this and I would have thought that the piping would detract from the image, but somehow the way the light plays on it and with this processing it adds to the image.  I normally don''t care for this type processing, but it works well for this image.  I do wish there was something in the tunnel to convey some sort of story....just a tunnel</td>', 'The light play is nice in this and I would have thought that the piping would detract from the image, but somehow the way the light plays on it and with this processing it adds to the image.  I normally don''t care for this type processing, but it works well for this image.  I do wish there was something in the tunnel to convey some sort of story....just a tunnel', '2009-08-12 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609489, 812914, 76598, '<td valign="top">Really like the coloring and the processing works well although I don''t usually like this type processing.  Again, just a picture of a tunnel....I think something or someone stuck in it might have added a little.</td>', 'Really like the coloring and the processing works well although I don''t usually like this type processing.  Again, just a picture of a tunnel....I think something or someone stuck in it might have added a little.', '2009-08-12 20:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609491, 812864, 76598, '<td valign="top">Missing the cave?  Focus seems soft, I like the repeating pattern of the animals.</td>', 'Missing the cave?  Focus seems soft, I like the repeating pattern of the animals.', '2009-08-12 20:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609492, 812890, 76598, '<td valign="top">Your choice of angle has added to the image and the lighting plays well with the structure of the tunnel. Nicely processed as well. I would have liked to have seen something in the tunnel</td>', 'Your choice of angle has added to the image and the lighting plays well with the structure of the tunnel. Nicely processed as well. I would have liked to have seen something in the tunnel', '2009-08-12 20:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609496, 812581, 76598, '<td valign="top">Ooooo, this might do well; an intriguing story line could be imagined here and I like the grafitti behind her.  Cute girl, like her hair, the light on her strikes me as being a little harsh but it may well add to the effect.</td>', 'Ooooo, this might do well; an intriguing story line could be imagined here and I like the grafitti behind her.  Cute girl, like her hair, the light on her strikes me as being a little harsh but it may well add to the effect.', '2009-08-12 20:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609503, 812841, 76598, '<td valign="top">Really like the texture on the culvert sides, lighting is good, but in the end you have a culvert.  I think the winning image is going to be conveying a story and have more than an empty tunnel.</td>', 'Really like the texture on the culvert sides, lighting is good, but in the end you have a culvert.  I think the winning image is going to be conveying a story and have more than an empty tunnel.', '2009-08-12 20:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609506, 812867, 76598, '<td valign="top">Really nice color, excellent choice of a perspective, I like the many repeating parts of the image as well.  This should do well.</td>', 'Really nice color, excellent choice of a perspective, I like the many repeating parts of the image as well.  This should do well.', '2009-08-12 20:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609512, 812283, 76598, '<td valign="top">I have commented on several images that all we have is pictures of tunnels and here you show how adding a little something can make an ordinary old tunnel sing, very nice job, like the clothing, he looks like he is hanging from the ceiling.  Good job.</td>', 'I have commented on several images that all we have is pictures of tunnels and here you show how adding a little something can make an ordinary old tunnel sing, very nice job, like the clothing, he looks like he is hanging from the ceiling.  Good job.', '2009-08-12 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609513, 812911, 76598, '<td valign="top">Abstract, but I really like the textures and all the ways it is twisted and the angles draw you in; technically it might the a shoehorn, but it works for me.</td>', 'Abstract, but I really like the textures and all the ways it is twisted and the angles draw you in; technically it might the a shoehorn, but it works for me.', '2009-08-12 20:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609514, 812858, 76598, '<td valign="top">I have a light just like that, but I really wish it wasn''t in the image; this looks like a unique place but somehow this isn''t calling my name, no focal point, no story to be seen.</td>', 'I have a light just like that, but I really wish it wasn''t in the image; this looks like a unique place but somehow this isn''t calling my name, no focal point, no story to be seen.', '2009-08-12 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609517, 812837, 76598, '<td valign="top">A little more DOF and perhaps focusing on the outer edge rather than just inside the nest might have added to it, in total it isn''t drawing me in.</td>', 'A little more DOF and perhaps focusing on the outer edge rather than just inside the nest might have added to it, in total it isn''t drawing me in.', '2009-08-12 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609520, 812527, 76598, '<td valign="top">You need a kids foot flying from that top edge, this might work as an abstract image, but it doesn''t speak to me other than perhaps like that.</td>', 'You need a kids foot flying from that top edge, this might work as an abstract image, but it doesn''t speak to me other than perhaps like that.', '2009-08-12 20:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609523, 812582, 76598, '<td valign="top"><b>Really</b> like the lighting and the "mangy" look of your subject really adds to the image.  If I were to ask for more, it would be to see more of the cave.</td>', 'Really like the lighting and the "mangy" look of your subject really adds to the image.  If I were to ask for more, it would be to see more of the cave.', '2009-08-12 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609525, 812461, 76598, '<td valign="top">Excellent, love the colors, love the partial column to the left; there is a lot to see in this image, it should do well.</td>', 'Excellent, love the colors, love the partial column to the left; there is a lot to see in this image, it should do well.', '2009-08-12 20:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609528, 812920, 76598, '<td valign="top">I have always wanted to see and photograph the cliff dwellings.  It strikes me that the DOF is too shallow and the point of focus is the near wall....I wish more was in focus and the focus point was further into the image.  It is probably a time of day issue, but I wish the image was a little warmer, a play with the white balance warming it up might be interesting to try.</td>', 'I have always wanted to see and photograph the cliff dwellings.  It strikes me that the DOF is too shallow and the point of focus is the near wall....I wish more was in focus and the focus point was further into the image.  It is probably a time of day issue, but I wish the image was a little warmer, a play with the white balance warming it up might be interesting to try.', '2009-08-12 20:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609530, 812915, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing, I like how the waves are playing in the arch at the same time.  I am not sure where you focus is, but my eye is telling me that I want the rock and pelicans in better focus.</td>', 'Very nice framing, I like how the waves are playing in the arch at the same time.  I am not sure where you focus is, but my eye is telling me that I want the rock and pelicans in better focus.', '2009-08-12 20:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609532, 812710, 76598, '<td valign="top">The processing adds a texture that makes this image work and I like the dark hole leaving you wish a question; I wish there was someone or something in the image to convey a message.  As it is, we have a picture of a tunnel...</td>', 'The processing adds a texture that makes this image work and I like the dark hole leaving you wish a question; I wish there was someone or something in the image to convey a message.  As it is, we have a picture of a tunnel...', '2009-08-12 20:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609535, 812769, 76598, '<td valign="top">You are drawn into the image by the rows in front and the symmetry bringing you to the stripped auto; but at the same time I don''t find that it appeals to me to look at....</td>', 'You are drawn into the image by the rows in front and the symmetry bringing you to the stripped auto; but at the same time I don''t find that it appeals to me to look at....', '2009-08-12 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609538, 812717, 76598, '<td valign="top">This looks like an interesting place, but it isn''t as visually appealing as I wish it was.  Since it is advanced editing you might have tried putting a really blue white balance on it to see if you could make the water pop out; it also strikes me that it might be lighter than the real cavern would be...I think it would be better if it were darker.</td>', 'This looks like an interesting place, but it isn''t as visually appealing as I wish it was.  Since it is advanced editing you might have tried putting a really blue white balance on it to see if you could make the water pop out; it also strikes me that it might be lighter than the real cavern would be...I think it would be better if it were darker.', '2009-08-12 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609542, 812652, 76598, '<td valign="top">Something makes the top brick look like they are moving, sort of a cool effect.  I would love to see this at night with some cool auto lights moving through it.  Off course, you might not be here to submit the picture if you did it at night would you.</td>', 'Something makes the top brick look like they are moving, sort of a cool effect.  I would love to see this at night with some cool auto lights moving through it.  Off course, you might not be here to submit the picture if you did it at night would you.', '2009-08-12 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609544, 812872, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect with the homeless man still and the others in motion.  Very good color too.  My top rated image in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool effect with the homeless man still and the others in motion.  Very good color too.  My top rated image in the challenge.', '2009-08-12 20:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609545, 812908, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like night shots, usually for the color, but your choice of B&amp;W is EXCELLENT in this scene and the vehicle lights really make this unique.  You may have a winner here.  Very nice composition as well....good scene, but you are drawn right to the focal point by the lights.  One of my top three in the challenge.</td>', 'I like night shots, usually for the color, but your choice of B&W is EXCELLENT in this scene and the vehicle lights really make this unique.  You may have a winner here.  Very nice composition as well....good scene, but you are drawn right to the focal point by the lights.  One of my top three in the challenge.', '2009-08-12 20:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609624, 812910, 101837, '<td valign="top">Great tones all around.  I am feeling like something is coming.</td>', 'Great tones all around.  I am feeling like something is coming.', '2009-08-12 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609639, 812710, 83313, '<td valign="top">I feel unbalanced and dizzy looking at this, as if I am about to fall down a mineshaft. Good job of conveying that. Probably not really a vertical hole, but that is the impression it gives me.</td>', 'I feel unbalanced and dizzy looking at this, as if I am about to fall down a mineshaft. Good job of conveying that. Probably not really a vertical hole, but that is the impression it gives me.', '2009-08-12 22:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609644, 812577, 83313, '<td valign="top">Smart thinking, making sure to identify this as NOT Antelope Canyon!</td>', 'Smart thinking, making sure to identify this as NOT Antelope Canyon!', '2009-08-12 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
