(5609733, 812879, 18799, '<td valign="top">The subject seems to be more about the monkeys than the tunnels/caves.  If someone showed me this picture and took it away and said describe it, I wouldn''t describe the caves.</td>', 'The subject seems to be more about the monkeys than the tunnels/caves.  If someone showed me this picture and took it away and said describe it, I wouldn''t describe the caves.', '2009-08-12 23:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609943, 812694, 108982, '<td valign="top">As I progressed through this series of pictures it became apparent that I am personally more drawn to those photos with geometric features over those with natural features. The thing I like best with your photo is that although there is an implied "direction"  there are no orientation markers except for the apparent trackway at the bottom.  I actually had to study the picture a bit to come to a conclusion as to the nature of the photo.  exceptional display of offset perspective and good use of DOF.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'As I progressed through this series of pictures it became apparent that I am personally more drawn to those photos with geometric features over those with natural features. The thing I like best with your photo is that although there is an implied "direction"  there are no orientation markers except for the apparent trackway at the bottom.  I actually had to study the picture a bit to come to a conclusion as to the nature of the photo.  exceptional display of offset perspective and good use of DOF.  I like it a lot.', '2009-08-13 04:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609945, 812911, 108982, '<td valign="top">just a very thought provoking photo.  I like to look at these without the photo name first.  I think it took me a while to realize this was a binding at all then it really became interesting.  One can nearly smell that pungent old moldy book smell. really unique take on the tunnel theme.</td>', 'just a very thought provoking photo.  I like to look at these without the photo name first.  I think it took me a while to realize this was a binding at all then it really became interesting.  One can nearly smell that pungent old moldy book smell. really unique take on the tunnel theme.', '2009-08-13 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
