(5610713, 812577, 104650, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors. I''m not sure about the square crop, there''s maybe<br/>a bit too much in the picture. Still, one of my favourites. (9)</td>', 'Amazing colors. I''m not sure about the square crop, there''s maybea bit too much in the picture. Still, one of my favourites. (9)', '2009-08-13 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
