(5612534, 812727, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking, I like the wet pavement and the tilt ass to the sense of motion.</td>', 'Cool looking, I like the wet pavement and the tilt ass to the sense of motion.', '2009-08-15 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5612536, 812427, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the shallow DOF and the lighting is interesting, but the actual subject seems to leave me wanting to see something more.</td>', 'I like the use of the shallow DOF and the lighting is interesting, but the actual subject seems to leave me wanting to see something more.', '2009-08-15 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5612538, 812919, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had the same problem as I did. It''s hard to capture such a wide dynamic range as the inside of a tunnel and the brightness outside. It''s an interesting shot and I''m not holding the slightly blown highlights against it.</td>', 'Looks like you had the same problem as I did. It''s hard to capture such a wide dynamic range as the inside of a tunnel and the brightness outside. It''s an interesting shot and I''m not holding the slightly blown highlights against it.', '2009-08-15 16:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5612540, 812527, 83313, '<td valign="top">My first thought was this looked like the headlamp of a car, but on second look, it could be one of those tunnels at a children''s playground.</td>', 'My first thought was this looked like the headlamp of a car, but on second look, it could be one of those tunnels at a children''s playground.', '2009-08-15 16:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
