(5612554, 812749, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, though I think the image could have used a little cranking up visually with some further adjustments. Maybe some burning on those bright highlights of the tower as well.</td>', 'I like the perspective, though I think the image could have used a little cranking up visually with some further adjustments. Maybe some burning on those bright highlights of the tower as well.', '2009-08-15 17:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
