(5612561, 812519, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, the whole tone of this shot comes off to me a little oddly. Perhaps some different adjustments could have given it a bit more visual impact. What are the two things that look like whiskers at the bottom right?</td>', 'I''m sorry, the whole tone of this shot comes off to me a little oddly. Perhaps some different adjustments could have given it a bit more visual impact. What are the two things that look like whiskers at the bottom right?', '2009-08-15 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
