(5613801, 812551, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, that is VERY cool!  Next time I''m out that way (most likely around December/January) I''ll give you a call and you can show me the fun places!</td>', 'Dang, that is VERY cool!  Next time I''m out that way (most likely around December/January) I''ll give you a call and you can show me the fun places!', '2009-08-17 01:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5613802, 812919, 83313, '<td valign="top">A 5.4 is not a bad showing. It''s just not a knock-em dead one either.<br/> <br/>A little burning might have helped on the trees outside. I think there is enough detail in them that some careful editing could have pulled some of it in. Perhaps a little dogding inside the tunnel, in order to show off just a bit more of that nice brickwork. Not too bright, however, don''t want to ruin the mood. As I said in my in-challenge comment, many of us had issues with overly bright highlights vs dark darks. If nothing else, it was a very educational challenge.</td>', 'A 5.4 is not a bad showing. It''s just not a knock-em dead one either. A little burning might have helped on the trees outside. I think there is enough detail in them that some careful editing could have pulled some of it in. Perhaps a little dogding inside the tunnel, in order to show off just a bit more of that nice brickwork. Not too bright, however, don''t want to ruin the mood. As I said in my in-challenge comment, many of us had issues with overly bright highlights vs dark darks. If nothing else, it was a very educational challenge.', '2009-08-17 01:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5613803, 812890, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great detail and light. And the angle and perspective give it a lot of excitement.</td>', 'Great detail and light. And the angle and perspective give it a lot of excitement.', '2009-08-17 01:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5613804, 812582, 30982, '<td valign="top">Different approach to the subject and a good one!</td>', 'Different approach to the subject and a good one!', '2009-08-17 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5613807, 811837, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect entry for the challenge.  I''m not a huge fan of spiders, but these guys are fascinating and you got a GREAT shot of him.  Nice work!</td>', 'Perfect entry for the challenge.  I''m not a huge fan of spiders, but these guys are fascinating and you got a GREAT shot of him.  Nice work!', '2009-08-17 01:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
