(5614086, 812872, 20506, '<td valign="top">Congrats Enzo on a wonderful image. I walk through this underpass a few days a week and often see Robert and give him money too. I''m intrigued by the drawings he does in the margins of the pavement and the words he writes, although I don''t really understand a lot of them. Must admit I''m always just making it to work in a rush! <br/> <br/>However I never saw this place as a picture, I guess on a daily basis we often do walk around blind to our surroundings. <br/> <br/>So far you''ve taken a photo of the building I work in and ribboned! and now my journey to work and ribboned! I''ve never seen these daily images quite so beautifully as you!</td>', 'Congrats Enzo on a wonderful image. I walk through this underpass a few days a week and often see Robert and give him money too. I''m intrigued by the drawings he does in the margins of the pavement and the words he writes, although I don''t really understand a lot of them. Must admit I''m always just making it to work in a rush!  However I never saw this place as a picture, I guess on a daily basis we often do walk around blind to our surroundings.  So far you''ve taken a photo of the building I work in and ribboned! and now my journey to work and ribboned! I''ve never seen these daily images quite so beautifully as you!', '2009-08-17 08:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5614087, 812461, 61222, '<td valign="top">WTG Mae congrats on your TOP 5. Beautiful image!!</td>', 'WTG Mae congrats on your TOP 5. Beautiful image!!', '2009-08-17 08:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5614088, 812563, 79720, '<td valign="top">Awesome title, cool location, love the light at the far end. The model''s pose is a bit awkward, and the strobe was a touch harsh...maybe dial it down (if you were in manual power) or set the negative exposure compensation.</td>', 'Awesome title, cool location, love the light at the far end. The model''s pose is a bit awkward, and the strobe was a touch harsh...maybe dial it down (if you were in manual power) or set the negative exposure compensation.', '2009-08-17 08:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
