(5614138, 812702, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought about trying something fun with the kids but ran out of time (and cooperative kids lol).  I love this!  It''s an adorable and creative idea.  And I''m glad you did not crop out the one on the left - his presence is like a hidden gem in the scene.</td>', 'I thought about trying something fun with the kids but ran out of time (and cooperative kids lol).  I love this!  It''s an adorable and creative idea.  And I''m glad you did not crop out the one on the left - his presence is like a hidden gem in the scene.', '2009-08-17 09:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5614140, 812879, 67697, '<td valign="top">These are like the best caves in Ohio ever!  :D   lol it does look like they are waiting in a queue line.  Looks great in black and white.</td>', 'These are like the best caves in Ohio ever!  :D   lol it does look like they are waiting in a queue line.  Looks great in black and white.', '2009-08-17 09:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5614173, 812891, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot makes me feel like I''m there.  The battle between light and dark is strong.  I feel the darkness over my right shoulder and I''m afraid to turn and see what''s lurking.  The light is beckoning, but then I''m exposed...such a conundrum!<br/> <br/>I actually liked this photo a lot (gave it a 9 during voting).  Is it perfect technically?  No.  Does it trigger an emotive response?  Yes!<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Something about this shot makes me feel like I''m there.  The battle between light and dark is strong.  I feel the darkness over my right shoulder and I''m afraid to turn and see what''s lurking.  The light is beckoning, but then I''m exposed...such a conundrum! I actually liked this photo a lot (gave it a 9 during voting).  Is it perfect technically?  No.  Does it trigger an emotive response?  Yes! Well done.', '2009-08-17 09:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
